{"diagnosis": "Failing signal max_addr stays 0x00000000 with TRAP: no progress vs expected advancing fetch over 256-word NOP mem. mem_do_wdata remains asserted after clear, blocking instruction fetch and preventing progress. Root cause at picorv32.v:1953 where the clear on !resetn||mem_done sets mem_do_wdata <= 1 instead of 0 (excerpt picorv32.v:1949-1954).", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1949,6 +1949,6 @@
		if (!resetn || mem_done) begin
			mem_do_prefetch <= 0;
			mem_do_rinst <= 0;
			mem_do_rdata <= 0;
-			mem_do_wdata <= 1;
+			mem_do_wdata <= 0;
		end
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), no TRAP: no progress, max_addr>0x00000000 with forward progress"}

